===Verb===
{{non-verb|blét|blétu|blótinn}}

# {{lb|non|Germanic paganism|transitive}} to [[worship]] (with sacrifice) {{+obj|non|acc}}
#: {{ux|non|Rauðgrani taldi heiðni ok forneskju fyrir mǫnnum Gests, ok taldi þat bezt at '''blóta''' til heilla sér.|Raudgrani related heathendom and ancient practice to the men of Gest, and said it was best to '''sacrifice''' for one's luck.}}
#* Óláfs saga Tryggvasonar (AM 61 fol manuscript, normalised orthography)
