#: {{ant|non|mikill}}

====Inflection====
This word has a suppletive inflection, using another root in the [[comparative]] and [[superlative]] forms, than in the [[positive]] form. Before the consonant cluster found in the contracted forms, the medial vowel is shortened from ''í'' to ''i'', so that ''lítlir > litlir''. Note also the unexpected ''-nn'' ending in the masculine accusative singular form (''líti'''nn''''' instead of ''litlan''), and the ''-t'' ending in the nominative and accusative singular neuter forms (''líti'''t''''' instead of ''lítilt'').
