From {{inh|non|gmq-pro|tr=*snaggwu-|ᛊᚾᚨᚷᚹᚢ}}, from {{inh|non|gem-pro|*snawwaz|t=rapid, sudden}}.<ref>{{R:gem:EDPG|page=461|head=*snawwa-}}</ref><ref>{{R:gem:HGE|page=357|head=*snawwaz}}</ref>

