Cognates includes {{cog|gmw-fri|toevje}}, {{cog|nl|toeven}} ({{cog|dum|toeven}}), {{cog|gml|tōven|t=to wait, hesitate, halt, delay, obstruct}},<ref>{{R:gem:EDPG|page=519|head=*tōba-}}</ref><ref>{{R:nl:Etymologiebank|toeven}}</ref> likely also {{cog|gem-pro|*tabōną||to grope}}.

